(PWM coolant setpoints. P=Hz, Q=duty percent, R=pressure psi.)
(Writes M68 E4/E5/E6. Laser owns E0-E3; do not reuse those channels.)
(Does not enable spray — that is stock M7/M8. M9 gates duty/pressure to 0 in HAL.)

o<m101> sub

o100 if [EXISTS[#<p>]]
    M68 E4 Q#<p>
o100 endif

o110 if [EXISTS[#<q>]]
    M68 E5 Q#<q>
o110 endif

o120 if [EXISTS[#<r>]]
    M68 E6 Q#<r>
o120 endif

o<m101> endsub

M2
